      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: Reporting here since I've previously mentioned native systems in VRChat also breaking, the one I've specifically mentioned (calibration clone being misplaced) was addressed, however there are additional features that break, one that has become notable since the update had gone live is the avatar hider diamonds, which no longer rotate with the head orientation in many cases, it is an issue since seeing a diamond facing you might be indicative of a user seeking your attention.",
